[[0,1347298,0,2,1,1,"2016-10-15T01:16:12","ShitLordWaifu","",[],"<p>Hi guys,\r\nSo a few months ago I ended up quitting my job, all because of this fat bitch who was my supervisor. I am young, I earned a pretty good paycheck for my age in this economy, but I didn't know how the system worked too well</p>\n<p>My last job, I was one of 2 girls out of 50 people in that department. The other girl was my supervisor. She is 5-9&quot; 300+. </p>\n<p>When I started the job, I worked in a different building under a male supervisor. Everyone loved me. i had a reputation of being a hard worker. When i moved buildings, my reputation went to I was lazy, stupid, and rude. I am an extremely polite person, I apologize for breathing to hard. I'm shy and awkward. This whole situation is not so fresh in my mind, so I'm less heated about it, but this fat, lazy person did awful things to me.</p>\n<p>She made me move things on a low height shelf in front of her commanding to do things because she was too lazy to stand up. She was literally the worst human being I have ever met. I am the sort of person who will stay till 10 pm at night, work my ass off, and still go to the gym after, sleep for 3 hours, and come back and work hard. Well, I ended up being given a task physically impossible to me and i broke something very important. Note, because I asked for help on a previous problem, I got a write up and was told I was no longer allowed to ask for help (which I should have reported) so I quit...I won't make excuses for my own actions, I didn't play the game right, but she still is a horrible, lazy, vindictive fat POS</p>\n<p>skip to today, a month after she just got my previous coworker fired... apparently rumors are spreading, everyone is refusing to work in her building, and she is under question. Stupid, fat bitch</p>\n<p>also I work for a thin work out girl now, shes super cute and thin and Im jealous and shes a total shitlord</p>","Karma is Getting this Fat Bitch","","fatpeoplehate"],[1,6567408,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-15T01:58:28","senoritademierda","",[],"<p>&quot;I apologize for breathing so hard&quot;, you said, she was probably offended because, you know, projection? </p>"],[2,6567428,6567408,3,0,3,"2016-10-15T02:02:21","ShitLordWaifu","",[],"<p>hahahaha, I mean it was a hyperbole, but I talked to friends and everyone thinks she was jealous of me</p>"],[3,6567502,6567428,1,0,1,"2016-10-15T02:13:03","fatsruineverything","",[],"<p>Jealous of you? Fat chance!</p>\n<p>That used to mean almost zero, but now it's like 80-90%. So yeah.</p>"],[1,6572618,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-15T21:13:58","theepilepticferret","",[],"<p>I too have had to quit a good job because of a horrible obeast boss. It's total bullshit, and I'm sorry that happened to you.</p>"]]
